## 2. What should and shouldn't go to GitHub?

| File | Upload? |
|---|---|
| `.c` | <badge color="success">Yes</badge> |
| `.cpp` | <badge color="success">Yes</badge> |
| `.py` | <badge color="success">Yes</badge> |
| `.java` | <badge color="success">Yes</badge> |
| `.h` | <badge color="success">Yes</badge> |
| `.exe` | <badge color="danger">No</badge> |
| `.class` | <badge color="danger">No</badge> |
| `.pyc` | <badge color="danger">No</badge> |
| `.vscode` personal settings | <badge color="warning">Usually no</badge> |
| `README.md` | <badge color="success">Yes</badge> |
| `.gitignore` | <badge color="success">Yes</badge> |

